SUMMARY:Cullman Veterans Hall of Fame Dinner and Ceremony
LOCATION:Loft 212\, 212 4th St SW\, Cullman\, AL 35055
DESCRIPTION:The Cullman Veterans Hall of Fame inducts its fourth class wit
 h a dinner and ceremony at Loft 212\, honoring county veterans from World
  War II\, Vietnam and the Global War on Terror. Doors open at 5:30 PM and
  the program starts at 6:15 PM. Each inductee receives a plaque that will
  hang in the courthouse. Time: Doors 5:30 PM\, ceremony 6:15 PM. Admissio
 n: Dinner event\; to attend\, contact VFW Post 2214\, DAV Chapter 101 or 
 American Legion Post 4. https://www.cullmantribune.com/2026/11/07/new-mem
 bers-of-cullman-veterans-hall-of-fame-to-be-honored-nov-17/
URL:https://www.cullmantribune.com/2026/11/07/new-members-of-cullman-veter
 ans-hall-of-fame-to-be-honored-nov-17/
